('127.888.d.25.A',4,'A surface that is dirty or oily can reduce a boot''s ability to:','["cool the wing", "shed ice", "carry fuel", "hold fuel"]'::jsonb,1,'Boot function.','original'),
('127.888.d.25.B',3,'A mechanic opens the manual to the inspection steps for an electric windshield wiper motor and linkage. She is:','["guessing", "ignoring the wipers", "locating and explaining the procedures for inspecting an electrically operated windshield wiper system", "painting the glass"]'::jsonb,2,'Wiper inspection.','original'),
('127.888.d.25.B',4,'During a wiper inspection, a mechanic should check the:','["tire tread", "fuel flow", "seat belts", "blade condition, arm tension and motor operation"]'::jsonb,3,'Wiper checks.','original'),
('127.888.d.25.C',3,'A mechanic follows the manual to remove a worn wiper blade and install a new one. She is:','["locating and explaining the procedures for replacing blades on a windshield wiper system", "guessing", "painting blades", "ignoring blades"]'::jsonb,0,'Wiper blades.','original'),
